{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, קְרֵב","hw":"קְרֵב","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">קְרֵב</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. approach (</strong>v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, קָרֵב\" href=\"/BDB,_קָרֵב\", dir=\"rtl\">I. קרב</a><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:26\" href=\"/Daniel.3.26\">Dn 3:26</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ל</span> loc.); 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִרְבֵת</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:16\" href=\"/Daniel.7.16\">7:16</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> pers.); abs., 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְּרִ֫בוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:8\" href=\"/Daniel.3.8\">Dn 3:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:13\" href=\"/Daniel.6.13\">6:13</a>; Inf. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּמִקְרְבֵהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:21\" href=\"/Daniel.6.21\">6:21</a> <em>when he approached</em>, ל loc.<br><strong>Pa.</strong>  <em>offer</em> sacrifice: Impf. 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּקָרֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:17\" href=\"/Ezra.7.17\">Ezr 7:17</a>, c. acc. + <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> of altar.<br><strong>Haph.</strong> <strong>1.</strong>  = <strong>Pa.</strong>: c. acc. Pf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַקְרִ֫בוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:17\" href=\"/Ezra.6.17\">Ezr 6:17</a>, Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְהַקְרְבִין</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:10\" href=\"/Ezra.6.10\">10</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ל</span> dei). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>bring near:</em> Pf. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַקְרְבוּהִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:13\" href=\"/Daniel.7.13\">Dn 7:13</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">קֳדָם</span> dei).","next":"BDB Aramaic, קְרָב","prev":"BDB Aramaic, קְרָא"}